{"content":[{"c":["SHIMRON-MERON"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Canaanite city destroyed by Joshua on his northern military campaign in Palestine. The king of Shimron-meron was one of 31 kings defeated by Joshua (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.12.20","r":"Josh.12.20","rawR":"Josh.12.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.12.20","value":"Josh.12.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 12:20"},"). This king was perhaps one of the northern kings summoned by Jabin, king of Hazor, to combine forces in an attempt to defeat Joshua (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.11.1","r":"Josh.11.1","rawR":"Josh.11.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.11.1","value":"Josh.11.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"11:1"},"). In all probability, Shimron-meron was one of the 12 cities included in the territory allotted to Zebulun for an inheritance (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.19.15","r":"Josh.19.15","rawR":"Josh.19.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.19.15","value":"Josh.19.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"19:15"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"ShimronMeron","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 12:20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.12.20","rawQueryValue":"Josh.12.20","sourceRefExact":"Josh.12.20"},{"anchorText":"11:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.11.1","rawQueryValue":"Josh.11.1","sourceRefExact":"Josh.11.1"},{"anchorText":"19:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.19.15","rawQueryValue":"Josh.19.15","sourceRefExact":"Josh.19.15"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"941abac4c43dee93617b6413d312f3835209820c06e507763e1ea048e5c79561","sourceItemName":"ShimronMeron","sourceItemOrder":344,"sourceMember":"Articles/S.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"ShimronMeron","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Shimron-Meron","title":"Shimron-Meron","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}